      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LADY GIOVANNA (1) broke her maiden last start over 950m at Cowra when resuming, scoring by 1.5 lengths. Is lightly raced and has plenty of scope for improvement. Jacob Stiff was in the saddle on that occasion and retains the ride. Can go right on with the job now. BARRIEANNA (8) recorded a strong maiden win over 1200m at Wean last time, getting there by 1.3 lengths. Shaping up nicely and she cannot be underestimated. READY FOR LIFT OFF (7) didn't do a bad job when sixth last start after being in the firing line on the bend over 1400m at Dubbo, beaten 2.25 lengths. That followed a win at Cowra the start prior. Has the ability to find the winners' list. ELDERBERRY WINE (2) showed good early dash last start and held on well to finish a neck back in second over 950m at Cowra. Nicely placed to take this out.",
